# Clear leftover cancel_reason on active / awarded indents (praveen V1.0.15, PR #61).
# 1. clear_cancel_reason_on_indent_reactivation_and_award:
#    - trigger trg_clear_indent_cancel_reason_on_active_status: cancel_reason is cleared when an indent
#      is open, broadcast, awarded, assigned or deployed.
#    - one-time repair of leftover reasons on those rows (prod 2026-10-30, read-only: 0 rows).
#    - count_org_hub_metrics: fail-reason buckets count cancelled / expired only
#      (built on 20271027155402, which prod and preprod already have).
#
# Apply only via: npm run db:push-set -- clear-cancel-reason-on-award   (dry-run first; prod apply needs Vasanth's GO)
# Never via plain `supabase db push` / `npm run db:push`.
#
